# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/
qcoin_chain_state.json

# MacOS
.DS_Store

# Cargo.lock IS committed. This workspace ships executables (rust/ has a
# main.rs plus two more binaries), so the stock "leave it for libraries"
# advice this line used to carry does not apply -- and current Cargo
# guidance is to commit it for libraries too, since downstream consumers
# resolve their own and it only ever affects this repo's own builds.
#
# It matters concretely here: CI runs `git clean -fd` in a shared working
# tree, so an ignored lockfile was deleted before every run and each build
# re-resolved from scratch -- slow on a Pi, and two runs of the same commit
# could pick different versions.
deploy/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
